sequenceDiagram
    participant Exchange as Angel One Broker
    participant WSM as Singleton WebSocket Manager
    participant Trader as AutoTrader Engine
    participant ClientA as Client Dashboard (User A)
    participant ClientB as Client Dashboard (User B)

    Exchange->>WSM: Raw Tick Stream (e.g., RELIANCE, TCS)
    WSM->>WSM: Parse & Update Local Tick Cache
    
    par Fan-Out to Subscribed Clients
        WSM->>ClientA: Broadcast RELIANCE Tick
        WSM->>ClientB: Broadcast TCS Tick
    end

    par Trigger Execution Logic
        WSM->>Trader: Push Tick to Evaluation Queue
        Trader->>Trader: Calculate Indicators (RSI, MACD)
        alt Signal Triggered
            Trader->>Exchange: Execute Buy/Sell Order
            Trader->>WSM: Broadcast Order Status
            WSM->>ClientA: Notify Order Success
        else No Signal
            Trader-->>Trader: Ignore
        end
    end
